sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Donor
    participant FE as React Frontend
    participant API as PaymentController/API
    participant DB as SQL Server
    participant PG as SSLCommerz

    Donor->>FE: Click Donate and submit amount
    FE->>API: POST /api/payment/init
    API->>DB: Create donation(status=pending, txRef)
    DB-->>API: Pending donation saved
    API->>PG: Create payment session (amount, txRef, callbacks)
    PG-->>API: Return GatewayUrl
    API-->>FE: 200 { gatewayUrl }
    FE-->>Donor: Redirect to gateway
    Donor->>PG: Complete payment

    alt Payment Success
        PG->>API: success callback / IPN
        API->>DB: Update donation(status=completed)
        API->>DB: Increment campaign amountRaised
        API-->>PG: ACK
    else Payment Failed or Cancelled
        PG->>API: fail or cancel callback
        API->>DB: Update donation(status=failed/cancelled)
        API-->>PG: ACK
    end

    API-->>FE: Status endpoint reflects final state
    FE-->>Donor: Show payment result and receipt data
